# capture.py session: the machine state Kickstart 1.3 hands the bootblock, from a cold boot.
#   python tools/capture.py --game lemmings --script games/lemmings/scripts/handoff.dbg
# Kickstart reads the bootblock to 0x001558 and calls its code 12 bytes in, after the DOS\0
# header (docs/runtime.md, "Kickstart handoff"). The first `g` waits out the ROM's boot.
f 1564
!settle 20
g
!settle 2
fd
# Registers, then both CIAs and the drives, then the custom registers.
r
c
e
